# Frontend Electron React

Mother rule: `.ai/instructions/frontend-electron-react.md`.

Read `MEMORY.md` and `AI_BOARD.md` before editing.

- Build the edge desktop as an operational shell around the Go sidecar.
- Do not access MySQL or RabbitMQ directly from frontend code.
- Login, SSO, autostart, tray, health, page scope, and DTO changes must update `AI_BOARD.md`.
- Keep user-facing copy ready for Chinese, English, and Japanese.
